s/v1/","context":{"app_id":4350620,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4350620-1846651706682102","game_id":"steam-4350620","kind":"update","title":"0.7.0 Update: Bank Heist, Gore, Physical Reloading, and New Toys","summary":"Welcome to the Bank update. This version introduces a playable bank heist with a locked vault, collectible valuables, dog, drones, guards, and a getaway van. Plan your approach, grab the loot, and make it back to the van to complete the robbery. New Bank achievements reward everything from collecting valuables and using keycards to escaping without being spotted by cameras.The bank gives you more ways to experiment. Put on a security uniform to disguise yourself, find keycards to access locked a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682102","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4350620-1840944183776089","game_id":"steam-4350620","kind":"update","title":"0.5.0 Update: Prison, New Toys, Smarter NPCs, and Better Destruction","summary":"Welcome to the new Prison update. This version adds a full prison environment with cells, gates, watchtowers, lighting, props, NPCs, spawn waves, and arena logic. New characters such as prisoners, guards, and cooks now populate the scene, with more ambient behaviors like cooking, sweeping, working out, drinking, carrying items, and sitting.Building destruction and voxel physics have been significantly improved. Structures now break apart more believably, fragments behave more consistently, penet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T08:20:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4350620-1840944183776083","game_id":"steam-4350620","kind":"update","title":"0.6.0 Update: NightClub, Giant Avatars, Achievements, and Better ModTK","summary":"Welcome to the NightClub update. This version introduces a fully interactive nightclub scene with a playable DJ controller, dancing NPCs, gang fights and a complete drink & smoke system. A new achievement system tracks your progress across all maps.We've spent a lot of time retuning our custom physics parameters so destruction reacts more naturally to different kinds of force. Vehicle crashes feel heavier, blades cut and penetrate more reliably, heavy objects smash through structures with a clea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T08:18:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:44:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4350620-1832065502817580","game_id":"steam-4350620","kind":"update","title":"Voxel Playground v0.4 Update: Tutorial, Mods, Combat, and Better Destruction","summary":"This update makes Voxel Playground easier to learn, more fun to fight in, and more stable when the sandbox gets chaotic. It brings a bigger tutorial, stronger mod support, new mod experiences, better combat feel, improved lighting, and more reliable destruction.New Tutorial WorkThe tutorial has been expanded with a dedicated tutorial scene. It now teaches more of the sandbox directly, including opening the hand UI, driving, ranged weapons, melee weapons, the Gravity Gun, the Linker, the Thruster","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-09T14:09:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source